<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>本草经下经 - 分类 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%BB%8F/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.1 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 10:07:22 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%BB%8F/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>二五七、铅丹</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/257-qiandan/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 10:07:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/257-qiandan/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%BB%8F/">本草经下经</category><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;金属类的药比较沉，铅丹用于治疗癫痫。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;小编：打铁花的生铁落。这个可是治疗狂躁症、癫痫、精神病非常好的一味药。（柴胡加龙骨牡蛎汤，里边的铅丹，可以用生铁落代替，效果非常好，还没副作用）&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>二五六、礜石</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/256-yushi/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 10:06:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/256-yushi/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%BB%8F/">本草经下经</category><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;也叫青分石、固羊石，很毒，人吃了就中毒，蚕宝宝吃了反而不饿，就不想吃蚕叶了。这个药用的不多，各位知道就好。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="本经原文"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【本经原文】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e6%9c%ac%e7%bb%8f%e5%8e%9f%e6%96%87" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;味辛，大热，有毒。治寒热，鼠瘘，蚀疮，死肌，风痹，腹中坚癖，邪气，除热。生山谷。一名青分石，一名立制石，一名固羊石。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>二五五、石灰</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/255-shihui/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 10:05:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/255-shihui/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%BB%8F%E4%B8%8B%E7%BB%8F/">本草经下经</category><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;一般在山里找到青白色的石头，经过烘焙就可得到。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="本经原文"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【本经原文】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e6%9c%ac%e7%bb%8f%e5%8e%9f%e6%96%87" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;味辛，温。治疽，疡，疥瘙，热气，恶疮，癞疾，死肌，堕眉，杀痔虫，去黑子、息肉。生川谷。一名恶灰。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="产地"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【产地】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e4%ba%a7%e5%9c%b0" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;近山处皆有之，其石青白色，作窑烧之，则成石灰。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class="heading-element" id="性味"&gt;&lt;span&gt;【性味】&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e6%80%a7%e5%91%b3" class="heading-mark"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="octicon octicon-link" viewBox="0 0 16 16" version="1.1" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z"&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;味辛，性温，有毒&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;石灰温性药。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>